# Screenshot Evidence

This folder contains selected visual evidence for the AWS IAM Least Privilege Lab.

The screenshots are organized to support the main security story of the project: moving from risky IAM access patterns to a controlled least privilege model using Terraform, IAM groups, scoped policies, MFA-protected role assumption, Access Analyzer review, CloudTrail audit evidence, and positive/negative access validation.

